  "body": "Adds hub/hub/github.py: a GitHub webhook receiver (works for a GitHub App or a repo webhook) that turns pull_request, pull_request_review, workflow_run, check_suite and push events into task events. The board shows the PR state, and a task moves to review or done.\n\nThis PR is also the source of the real payload fixtures: its own PR object and CI runs, fetched with gh api.\n\nOpened overnight by Yang's agent.",
